oesn't explicitly require back/forward. But active-state semantics usually should track URL. QA focus says persistence and cancellation. Could mention as non-blocking residual risk? But PASS should not invent findings. We can note residual non-blocking. But final should be pass.\n\nNeed maybe include \"No blocking findings.\" Good.\n\nLet's craft final:\n\nVERDICT: PASS\n\nNo concrete regression/unmet acceptance supported. The diff adds Reports, preserves Board/Activity; single activeHash ensures at most one aria-current; anchor href updates hash; onClick closes menu (setOpen false); CSS min-width 761 ensures desktop links visible after resizing. Keyboard activation uses native click. Residual risks: active state is click-only and not synced to initial hash/hashchange/back-forward; mobile focus remains on link after menu closes (if hidden) but not acceptance failure in supplied diff. Hmm if we mention focus issue as residual, might seem should fail. But okay, \"not blocking.\"\n\nNeed ensure first line exactly. Final answer only.","type":"reasoning_text"}],"encrypted_content":"d2fd1b7e-d3c1-4146-b090-630702f184c1-0","status":"completed"},{"id":"8ecd1118-c271-4dcd-85e3-60fbf97fd53e","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"VERDICT: PASS\n\nNo concrete regression or unmet acceptance criterion is supported by the supplied diff.\n\nEvidence:\n- `Reports` is added with `href=\"#reports\"` while `Board` and `Activity` are preserved.\n- A single `activeHash` string ensures at most one nav link receives `aria-current=\"page\"`.\n- Native anchor behavior updates the URL hash; `handleSelect` does not prevent default.\n- `handleSelect` calls `setOpen(false)`, so mobile menu selection closes the menu and should update the Menu button’s existing `aria-expanded={open}` binding.\n- The desktop media rule ensures `.nav-links` remains visible at `min-width: 761px`, covering resize from mobile to desktop.\n\nNon-blocking residual risks: `activeHash` is click-local and does not sync to initial hash changes or browser back/forward, and mobile focus may remain on a link after the menu closes. Neither is a concrete failure against the stated acceptance criteria based on this diff.","type":"output_text","logprobs":[]}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":"final_answer"}],"timestamp":"2026-11-22T16:09:28.708459+00:00"}],"meta":{"snapshot_version":1,"aid":1,"role":"workflow_agent","model":"deepseek-flash","session_state":{"used_tokens":3800,"context_tokens":1339,"step_count":1,"markup_recovered":0,"recent_call_hashes":[],"reads_since_last_edit":0,"has_landed_write":false,"low_yield_since_progress":0,"distinct_evidence_count":0,"scout_ledger":[],"steps_since_progress":0,"wind_down_done":false,"wind_down_attempts":0,"wind_down_token_mark":0,"budget_reserve_consumed":false,"loop_blocked_since_progress":0,"loop_state":{"version":1,"edit_seq":0,"blocked_rounds":0,"last_counted_step":-1,"operations":{}},"write_effect_unknown":false,"last_progress_unknown":false,"phase":"done","terminal_reason":"completed","pending_events":[],"pending_external_user_turn":null,"active_turn_start_message_index":null,"completed_turn_start_message_index":2,"pending_step_latency":null,"submitted_summary":null,"anthropic_history":null},"run_id":"workflow-81899c8e763740b492aa776ce0ddd672"},"seen_result_hashes_reset":false,"seen_result_hashes_added":[]}
